    "name": "Relax In Space",
    "steam_appid": 2061010,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2061010/extras/1246f82ec3823e178a703f4c2e4a54d8.poster.avif?t=1754288695\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2061010/extras/1246f82ec3823e178a703f4c2e4a54d8.webm?t=1754288695\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2061010/extras/1246f82ec3823e178a703f4c2e4a54d8.mp4?t=1754288695\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Relax In Space</strong> is a solo-built cosmic trip where you drift through planets, stars, black holes, and bizarre art galleries, all designed for you to zone out, vibe to your own music, and question reality without ever pressing a \u201cStart Game\u201d button. Some moments you\u2019re in first person, other times you\u2019re floating like a camera on mushrooms\u2014either way, no rules, no scores, just visuals that get weirder the longer you stare. It\u2019s a universe that doesn\u2019t need you to win\u2014just to <i>let go</i>. You can visit celestials. There is a virtual art gallery.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2061010/extras/f709c9decbe7c9de05d50275f10a2223.poster.avif?t=1754288695\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2061010/extras/f709c9decbe7c9de05d50275f10a2223.webm?t=1754288695\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2061010/extras/f709c9decbe7c9de05d50275f10a2223.mp4?t=1754288695\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Other details</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- 4K Graphics</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- HD Audio</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Virtual Art Museum</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Replicas of the Sun, Earth, Moon, and Jupiter can be found</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Different star types, blue, red, orange</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Different black holes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- And more</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Ambient music will be included but can be turned off if you want to listen to your own music. If you're a musician or artist, we would love to work with you and feature your art or music in the game; contact us if you are interested! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Relax In Space was inspired by films like Interstellar, The Martian, GRAVITY, and more. Relax In Space provides you with the ability to travel and experience new worlds from the comfort of your home. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Some parts of this game include flashing lights!</strong> If you have a sensitivity to lights or flashing lights please be aware! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Get up close and personal with ultra high detailed planets like Earth </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2061010/extras/1ccbda5e59b1be6b3433e9efa197b82b.avif?t=1754288695\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Future Update Considerations -  <br>- Experimental VR Support </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">------------------------------------</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2061010/extras/dd9124abe6bf6bd35dcf2aaae8e252b0.poster.avif?t=1754288695\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2061010/extras/dd9124abe6bf6bd35dcf2aaae8e252b0.webm?t=1754288695\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2061010/extras/dd9124abe6bf6bd35dcf2aaae8e252b0.mp4?t=1754288695\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2061010/extras/1246f82ec3823e178a703f4c2e4a54d8.poster.avif?t=1754288695\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2061010/extras/1246f82ec3823e178a703f4c2e4a54d8.webm?t=1754288695\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2061010/extras/1246f82ec3823e178a703f4c2e4a54d8.mp4?t=1754288695\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Relax In Space</strong> is a solo-built cosmic trip where you drift through planets, stars, black holes, and bizarre art galleries, all designed for you to zone out, vibe to your own music, and question reality without ever pressing a \u201cStart Game\u201d button. Some moments you\u2019re in first person, other times you\u2019re floating like a camera on mushrooms\u2014either way, no rules, no scores, just visuals that get weirder the longer you stare. It\u2019s a universe that doesn\u2019t need you to win\u2014just to <i>let go</i>. You can visit celestials. There is a virtual art gallery.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2061010/extras/f709c9decbe7c9de05d50275f10a2223.poster.avif?t=1754288695\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2061010/extras/f709c9decbe7c9de05d50275f10a2223.webm?t=1754288695\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2061010/extras/f709c9decbe7c9de05d50275f10a2223.mp4?t=1754288695\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Other details</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- 4K Graphics</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- HD Audio</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Virtual Art Museum</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Replicas of the Sun, Earth, Moon, and Jupiter can be found</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Different star types, blue, red, orange</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Different black holes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- And more</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Ambient music will be included but can be turned off if you want to listen to your own music. If you're a musician or artist, we would love to work with you and feature your art or music in the game; contact us if you are interested! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Relax In Space was inspired by films like Interstellar, The Martian, GRAVITY, and more. Relax In Space provides you with the ability to travel and experience new worlds from the comfort of your home. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Some parts of this game include flashing lights!</strong> If you have a sensitivity to lights or flashing lights please be aware! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Get up close and personal with ultra high detailed planets like Earth </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2061010/extras/1ccbda5e59b1be6b3433e9efa197b82b.avif?t=1754288695\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Future Update Considerations -  <br>- Experimental VR Support </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">------------------------------------</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2061010/extras/dd9124abe6bf6bd35dcf2aaae8e252b0.poster.avif?t=1754288695\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2061010/extras/dd9124abe6bf6bd35dcf2aaae8e252b0.webm?t=1754288695\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2061010/extras/dd9124abe6bf6bd35dcf2aaae8e252b0.mp4?t=1754288695\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p>",
    "short_description": "This cosmic walking simulator doesn\u2019t ask you to aim, shoot, or do math\u2014it just is. Bring your own music and relax by yourself to meditate on good mushrooms. Perfect for those nights when you wanna float, not stress. Reality gets questioned and your munchies get cosmic.",
